---
// Displays the connected user's real avatar (from PocketBase's `avatars`
// collection via the `avatar` relation on `users`), big and centered —
// the main visual focus of the app home. Filled in by app.astro's script
// once the session is confirmed. Clicking it reopens the avatar picker.
---

<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
	<button
		id="user-avatar-circle"
		type="button"
		aria-label="Choisir mon avatar"
		class="user-character h-[clamp(300px,52vh,620px)] md:max-xl:h-[260px] max-md:h-[240px] w-full cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center bg-transparent transition hover:scale-[1.02]"
	>
		<img id="user-avatar-img" src="" alt="" class="h-full w-full object-contain" />
	</button>
</div>
